  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://rssb.rajasthan.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Rajasthan Staff Selection Board (RSSB)</a> </span>has released the final answer key for the post of Level I Primary School Teacher Posts on the official website of RSSB. This recruitment was released for 5636 posts. Applications for the RSSB REET Mains Primary Teacher Recruitment 2025 were accepted from November 07, 2025, to December 06, 2025. The online examination was held on 17-20 January 2026. Candidates <span data-teams=\"true\">who appeared for this examination</span> can download their RSSB REET Mains Primary Teacher Final Answer Key 2026 from the link given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Rajasthan Staff Selection Board (RSSB)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">RSSB REET Mains Primary Teacher Final Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">RSSB Advt No. : 08/2025&nbsp;</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>06 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>07 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>06 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>06 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>17-20 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>12 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key : <strong>27 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result : <strong>27 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Final Answer Key : <strong>03 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC (Creamy Layer) <strong>: Rs. 600/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EWS , OBC (Non Creamy Layer) <strong>:</strong> <strong>Rs. 400/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH <strong>: Rs. 400/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Charge&nbsp;<b>: Rs. 300/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RSSB REET Mains Primary Teacher Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 January 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per RSSB REET Mains Primary Teacher Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RSSB REET Mains Primary Teacher 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 5636 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 45.6116%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.7399%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Area</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.6484%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 45.6116%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Primary School Teacher</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.7399%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Non-TSP</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.6484%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">5109</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.7399%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">TSP</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.6484%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">527</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>RSSB REET Mains Primary Teacher Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Must Have Passed REET Exam.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">10+2 (Intermediate) Exam with 50% Marks with Passed / Appearing 2 Year Diploma in Elementary&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"google-anno-t\">Education</span>&nbsp;<strong>OR</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">10+2 (Intermediate) Exam with at least 45% marks and 2-year diploma in Elementary Education, in accordance with the NCTE Regulations 2002 <strong>OR</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">10+2 (Intermediate) Exam with 50% Marks and B.E.l.Ed 4 Year Course&nbsp;<strong>OR</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">10+2 (Senior Secondary) Exam with 50% Marks and Diploma in Education (Spl)&nbsp;<strong>OR</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Bachelor Degree with 2 Year Diploma in Elementary Education</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download RSSB REET Mains Primary Teacher Final Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In order to download the RSSB REET Mains Primary Teacher Final Answer Key candidates need to go to the link provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading their RSSB REET Mains Primary Teacher Final Answer Key.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates will find the RSSB REET Mains Primary Teacher Final Answer Key Page displaying.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">For Downloading their Final Answer Key Candidates will be redirected to the Login Page here they have provide their following details-:</span><br>\n<span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Registration Number</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Password/DOB</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Click in the ‘Login’ Icon.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates can also download their Mains Primary Teacher Final Answer Key from official site of the RSSB.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RSSB REET Mains Primary Teacher Recruitment 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\